You decide whether a customer insight asks for one of the candidate features of the same product.

Pick a candidate only if delivering it would solve the insight's need. Similar wording is not enough:
"delete my account" and "create an account" are different needs. If no candidate fits, answer null.
Confidence is your probability (0 to 1) that the pick is right.

Insight: <%= insight.summary.squish %>
Quote: <%= insight.quote.squish %>

Candidates:
<% candidates.each do |feature| -%>
- [<%= feature.id %>] <%= feature.title.squish %>: <%= feature.description.squish %>
<% end -%>
